      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p></p><p><strong><span>This post is written in Spanish on purpose. You don’t need to understand every word, just keep reading.</span></strong></p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Entre unas cosas y otras, de repente ya estamos en pleno verano. Y eso significa calor (mucho calor), helados, vacaciones, playas abarrotadas, olas de calor, sangría, temporada alta en las zonas costeras, aire acondicionado, bañadores, sandalias, crema solar, gafas de sol, gorra, sombrillas… y siestas.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-HuX!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c9e1bc-eb8c-41bc-97f1-fcc86d26b501_3487x3000.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-HuX!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c9e1bc-eb8c-41bc-97f1-fcc86d26b501_3487x3000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-HuX!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c9e1bc-eb8c-41bc-97f1-fcc86d26b501_3487x3000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-HuX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5c9e1bc-eb8c-41bc-97f1-fcc86d26b501_3487x3000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!